// title: BadSuccessor Detection
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceRegistryEvents, SecurityEvent
// purpose: BadSuccessor Detection
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/BadSuccessor%20Detection.kql
// kind: repo
